 16 │ The core of Ledgerline’s caching is built around storing the *results* of database queries, not just the raw SQL statements. When a `Ledgerline.query()` call executes a query that matches an entry in the Query Result Cache, Ledgerline immediately returns the cached result instead of hitting the database. 
    · ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    ·                                                                  ╰── Dms tell: dms.machine
